: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">澳洲日前因倚賴煤炭，遭批對太平洋島國構成「生存威脅」後，坎培拉當局<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">12</span>日宣布，將提供<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">5</span>億澳元（約新臺幣<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">106.3</span>億元）金援，協助這些島國發展再生能源，因應愈漸嚴峻的氣候變遷。</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">太平洋島國論壇（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">PIF</span>）<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">13</span>至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">16</span>日在吐瓦魯舉行高峰會，吐瓦魯總理索本嘉會前對澳洲的氣候計畫表示歡迎；但仍強調其須採取「實際行動」，減少碳排放。他表示，「無論你在桌子上放多少錢，都不會給你做錯事的藉口，包括開發礦場」。澳洲近日批准昆士蘭省「阿達尼礦場」開發計畫，引起太平洋國家不安。</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-in